{
  "version": 2,
  "name": "Strobe",
  "description": "SCENE_FX P3 scene-mod preset: a beat-quantised light strobe. node.beat_gate drives the light's port-shadowed intensity input, so the flash is locked to the tempo and the amount knob sets peak brightness.",
